{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"わぁぁ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこたんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなったんのケーキ食べたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくれてるにもかかわらず\n昨日のチーズケーキを家族で\n食べてしまってすごく後悔してる\n最中です（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また近々作ろっかな？(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんはいつも\n私が作るものを美味しい〜って\n食べてくれるから\n作る私も本当に幸せなんです(。-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもいくちゃんからは\n私がケーキを持って行くとも\n言っていないのに\n「ケーキとっといてね！」\nっていうメールが来た(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすが食いしん坊女王は\n考えが3歩先を行ってる...（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/03/01/8474157/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香がバースデーライブの時に\n作ってくれたケーキ∩^ω^∩♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早いもので明日はバレッタの\n個別握手会最終日！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天気予報によると\n明日もまた雪が降るみたいで(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会に雪は付き物なのか\nはたまた乃木坂メンバーに\n雪女がいるのか...（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん私のように\n転びまくったりすることの\nないように願ってます(ToT)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その代わりと言ったらなんですが\nまなったんレーンに辿り着いて\nくれた方は私がしーっかり\nみなさんのこと暖めるので♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、明日は\n最後の最後まで残っててくれた\n方には何か素敵なことが\n起こっちゃうんです(∩^ω^∩)へっへっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お時間に余裕があったら\nぜひ最後まで居てみてください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみ〜♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ一個クイズ出しとくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が乃木坂メンバーの中で\n1日だけ入れ替われるとしたら\n入れ替わってみたいメンバーは\n誰でしょう？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会に来る方は\nぜひそこで答え合わせ\nしましょ〜(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/03/01/8474157/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウインクっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ昨日盛りだくさん書いたから\nちょっぴり短めだけど\nこの辺でヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田と寧々とあみの3部作の\n映画早く観たいなぁ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/03/01/8474157/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニーハイ×肩出し♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！乃木坂46SHOW\n只今放送中(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初のそんなバカな・・・\nテレビで完全再現！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コント面白い（笑）"}],"source":"archive"}